#: ../../universities.rst:4
msgid ""
"40 profiles with evidence, contact routes and an application checklist. "
"Published existence is distinguished from current intake."
msgstr "40份档案，附来源、联系渠道及申请清单。机构存在与当前招募情况分别标注。"

#: ../../universities.rst:6
msgid ""
"All 40 undergraduate institutions in the official Shanghai register have "
"an institutional profile here. Some have documented science-park or "
"technology-transfer contacts; others have a general institutional route. "
"A profile does not assert that a dedicated startup program is open."
msgstr "官方上海名录中的40所本科院校均有机构档案。部分有科技园或技术转移联系渠道，其他仅有机构对接入口。档案不代表专属创业项目正在开放。"

#: ../../universities.rst:8
